ost powerful</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">★ 4.4 · 960 reviews</div>\n      <div class=\"small\"><b>Best for:</b> Video editing, 3D and gaming</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card pick n stack\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h3>Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best value</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">★ 4.2 · 2,310 reviews</div>\n      <div class=\"small\"><b>Best for:</b> Students and light office work</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Specs side by side</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Highlighted cells mark the best value in each row.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"scroll\">\n    <table class=\"table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Spec</th><th>Aero 14</th><th>Forge 16</th><th>Nimbus 13</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Price</td><td>$1,299</td><td>$1,899</td><td class=\"best\">$999</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.2 kg</td><td>2.1 kg</td><td class=\"best\">1.0 kg</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Battery life</td><td>18 h</td><td>9 h</td><td class=\"best\">22 h</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Screen</td><td>14\" OLED</td><td>16\" IPS 165Hz</td><td>13\" IPS</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td class=\"best\">16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>RAM</td><td>16 GB (soldered)</td><td class=\"best\">32 GB (upgradeable)</td><td>16 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Storage</td><td>512 GB</td><td class=\"best\">1024 GB (upgradeable)</td><td>256 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Ports</td><td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td><td class=\"best\">2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card</td><td>2x USB-C, headphone</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Rating</td><td class=\"best\">4.6 / 5</td><td>4.4 / 5</td><td